'''Baron Seal Strikes''' (ヒュージゴマ強襲 ''Hyūji Goma Kyōshū'') was an event added in [[Version 9.3 Update|Version 9.3]]. Like all [[Gauntlet]]s, progress made in Baron Seal Strikes would reset when the event ended, allowing the player to collect the rewards again once the event returned. The boss of this Gauntlet was [[Baron Seal]], a longer-ranged variant of [[Sir Seal]] with [[Freeze|freeze]] and [[Weaken|weaken]] abilities. As of [[Version 10.7 Update|Version 10.7]], this event was replaced with the [[Baron Seal Strikes|new version]] with 20 levels.

==Overview==
===About===
Baron Seal Strikes contained a total of 60 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''Red Alert''', spread across 3 different maps: '''Baron Seal Strikes!''' (Red Alerts 1~20), '''Baron Seal Strikes!!''' (Red Alerts 21~40) and '''Baron Seal Strikes!!!''' (Red Alerts 41~60). After beating a Red Alert, the player has to wait for 30 minutes before they could proceed to the next one. Rewards for the first completion of a Red Alert could include [[Battle Items]], [[Catseye]]s, [[Catfruit]], [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]], [[Gamatoto Expedition|Catamins]], [[Ototo Corps|Materials]] and [[Cat Energy|Leaderships]]. Every 20 Red Alerts played out the same, but the strength magnifications and enemy base's HP were increased with each level.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Baron Seal Strikes (Old)/Red Alert 1~20]], [[Baron Seal Strikes (Old)/Red Alert 21~40]] and [[Baron Seal Strikes (Old)/Red Alert 41~60]].''

==Play Requirements==
*Baron Seal Strikes! was unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1.
*Baron Seal Strikes!! was unlocked after clearing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1 and appeared 2 days into the event.
*Baron Seal Strikes!!! was unlocked after clearing [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 1 and appeared 4 days into the event.

